{{Dex/Form|Midday Form}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Sword|t=FFF|entry=This Lycanroc is calm and cautious. The rocks jutting from its mane are razor sharp.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Shield|t=FFF|entry=With swift movements, this Pokémon gradually backs its prey into a corner. Lycanroc's fangs are always aimed toward opponents' weak spots.}}
{{Dex/Form|Midnight Form}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Sword|t=FFF|entry=This form of Lycanroc is reckless. It charges headlong at its opponents, attacking without any care about what injuries it might receive.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Shield|t=FFF|entry=It's invigorated by powerful opponents–the stronger the better. A full-force headbutt from one of these Lycanroc can shatter giant boulders.}}
{{Dex/Form|Dusk Form}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Sword|t=FFF|entry=This form of Lycanroc is normally calm and quiet. Once a {{pkmn|battle}} begins, however, this Pokémon displays a ferocious fighting spirit.}}
{{Dex/Entry1|v=Shield|t=FFF|entry=These Pokémon have both calm and ferocious qualities. Their temperamental nature makes them a difficult species to raise.}}
